url: "https://github.com/ComunidadIA-OS/Edge-AI-for-Situational-Awareness-in-Emergencies"
abstract: >-
  Heimdall is an edge-AI system for real-time wildfire situational awareness.
  It detects fire on an NVIDIA Jetson with a custom thermal vision model
  (Heimdall-Vision-TensorRT-F16), forecasts fire spread with an explainable
  physical model (Balbi 2015), and streams results to a 3D operations
  dashboard. The system is advisory only and requires human-in-the-loop
  validation. Original code is Apache-2.0; the YOLO-derived vision model is
  AGPL-3.0.
keywords:
  - edge-ai
  - wildfire-detection
